  displayName: Infantry Squad
  role: 0
  description: 'The backbone of an army: ten riflemen led by a Sergeant. Their Assault
    Rifles reach 20 m, and with ten soldiers the squad can soak up casualties and
    still hold ground or push forward. Once per battle the squad can lob a Frag Grenade
    over walls to hit enemies sheltering in cover. Infantry can be taken more than
    once, so most armies field several squads to form their battle line.'
